---
import WhatsAppCTA from '../WhatsAppCTA.astro';

const sectores = ['Hostelería', 'Peluquería y estética', 'Talleres', 'Inmobiliarias', 'Clínicas y salud', 'Comercio local', 'Autónomos'];
const marqueeItems = [...sectores, ...sectores];
---

<section id="top" data-animate class="relative overflow-hidden pt-28 pb-8 sm:pt-36">
	<div data-reveal class="piece piece-top piece-d0 marquee-mask mx-auto max-w-3xl">
		<div class="marquee-track">
			{
				marqueeItems.map((s) => (
					<span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-800 bg-white/[0.03] px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-400">
						<span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-indigo-400" />
						{s}
					</span>
				))
			}
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 text-center sm:px-6">
		<p data-reveal class="piece piece-top piece-d1 mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-indigo-400/30 bg-indigo-500/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-300">
			<span class="live-dot h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400"></span>
			Ya instalando en negocios de la Comunitat Valenciana
		</p>
		<h1 data-reveal class="piece-pixel piece-d2 mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-[13vw] leading-[0.98] font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
			Tus tarjetas de papel van a la basura. <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Las nuestras siempre van contigo.</span>
		</h1>
		<p data-reveal class="piece piece-bottom piece-d3 mx-auto mt-6 max-w-lg text-lg text-zinc-400">
			Nada que guardar en un cajón, nada que tirar al salir del local. Con un toque, tu contacto o
			tu reseña de Google se quedan guardados en su móvil para siempre — vayan donde vayan. Nosotros
			traemos la tarjeta, la configuramos y la dejamos funcionando delante de ti.
		</p>
		<div data-reveal class="piece piece-bottom piece-d4 mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
			<WhatsAppCTA texto="Habla por WhatsApp" mensaje="Hola, quiero información sobre 096matics" />
			<a href="#productos" class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-300 transition-colors hover:text-white">
				Ver qué se queda con ellos ↓
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div data-reveal class="piece piece-d5 connector-beam mx-auto mt-10 h-10 w-px" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<p data-reveal class="piece piece-d5 mx-auto -mt-1 text-center text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-zinc-600 uppercase">
		Esto es lo que se queda con ellos
	</p>

	<div data-reveal class="piece piece-pop piece-d6 pulse-stage relative mx-auto mt-6 h-[200px] max-w-4xl sm:h-[260px]" aria-hidden="true">
		<svg viewBox="0 0 800 220" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMax meet" class="h-full w-full">
			{
				[40, 88, 136, 184, 232, 280].map((r, i) => (
					<circle
						cx="400"
						cy="220"
						r={r}
						fill="none"
						stroke="#818cf8"
						stroke-width="1"
						stroke-opacity={0.55 - i * 0.08}
						class="pulse-ring"
						style={`animation-delay:${i * 0.4}s`}
					/>
				))
			}
			<circle cx="400" cy="220" r="5" fill="#c7d2fe" />
		</svg>

		<div class="pulse-label pulse-label-left absolute top-[28%] left-[14%] -translate-x-1/2 text-left sm:top-[22%] sm:left-[20%]">
			<p class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-zinc-300">Guarda tu contacto</p>
		</div>
		<div class="pulse-label pulse-label-right absolute top-[28%] right-[14%] translate-x-1/2 text-right sm:top-[22%] sm:right-[20%]">
			<p class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-zinc-300">Deja una reseña</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<ul data-reveal class="piece piece-bottom piece-d6 mx-auto mt-2 flex max-w-lg flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 px-5 sm:px-6">
		<li class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-500">
			<svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" class="shrink-0 text-indigo-400"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" /></svg>
			No caduca ni se queda en un cajón
		</li>
		<li class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-500">
			<svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" class="shrink-0 text-indigo-400"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" /></svg>
			Tú eliges cuál de los dos toca
		</li>
		<li class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-500">
			<svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" class="shrink-0 text-indigo-400"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" /></svg>
			La dejamos activa antes de irnos
		</li>
	</ul>
</section>

<style>
	.marquee-mask {
		overflow: hidden;
		mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, black 10%, black 90%, transparent);
		-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, black 10%, black 90%, transparent);
	}
	.marquee-track {
		display: flex;
		width: max-content;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		animation: marquee-scroll 26s linear infinite;
	}
	.marquee-mask:hover .marquee-track {
		animation-play-state: paused;
	}
	@keyframes marquee-scroll {
		from {
			transform: translateX(0);
		}
		to {
			transform: translateX(-50%);
		}
	}
	.live-dot {
		animation: live-dot-pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
	}
	@keyframes live-dot-pulse {
		0%,
		100% {
			opacity: 1;
		}
		50% {
			opacity: 0.35;
		}
	}
	.connector-beam {
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.55));
	}
	.pulse-stage {
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.pulse-ring {
		transform-origin: 400px 220px;
		animation: pulse-ring-grow 4.8s ease-out infinite;
		opacity: 0;
	}
	@keyframes pulse-ring-grow {
		0% {
			opacity: 0;
			transform: scale(0.75);
		}
		12% {
			opacity: 0.9;
		}
		70% {
			opacity: 0.15;
		}
		100% {
			opacity: 0;
			transform: scale(1.06);
		}
	}
	.pulse-label {
		opacity: 0;
		transform: translateY(6px);
	}
	.is-revealing .pulse-label-left {
		animation: pulse-label-in 0.6s 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;
	}
	.is-revealing .pulse-label-right {
		animation: pulse-label-in 0.6s 1.05s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;
	}
	@keyframes pulse-label-in {
		to {
			opacity: 1;
			transform: none;
		}
	}
	@media (max-width: 420px) {
		.pulse-label {
			display: none;
		}
	}
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.pulse-ring {
			animation: none;
			opacity: 0.35;
		}
		.marquee-track {
			animation: none;
		}
		.live-dot {
			animation: none;
		}
	}
</style>
